  <h2 class="u-12 sec">Built to WCAG 2.2 AA.</h2>
  <p class="u-13 lead">Real text over images, visible keyboard focus, logical heading order, alt text on meaningful images, reduced-motion respected, and no meaning carried by color alone. Found something that falls short? Tell us: <a href="mailto:contact@uncost.org">contact@uncost.org</a> — accessibility reports get priority.</p>
